<article class="env-lemma" id="01TG">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01TG">Lemma <span data-tag="01TG">29.21.5</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $x \in X$ be a point. Set $s = f(x)$. If $f$ is quasi-finite at $x$, then the residue field extension $\kappa (x)/\kappa (s)$ is finite. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear from Algebra, Definition <a href="/tag/00PL" data-tag="00PL">10.122.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>